     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you very much for your reply.<br><br><br>I need Rating Scale Model because I have an item bank  where the same set\r\nof response alternatives is applied to all the items in the test and for these kind of items isn&#39;t RSM suppose to fit the best?<br><br>I am afraid if I have comprehended the part getting gpcm from RSMs . Phil, can you please give me an example?</div>"
